# Design system

## Read first

- `specs/README.md` — index
- `specs/tokens/token-reference.md` — CSS variables and Tailwind aliases
- `AGENTS.md` — agent checklist

## Token layers

1. **Kalep / `@bolteu/design-tokens`** — `text-primary`, `bg-neutral-secondary`, Kalep `Text`, `ListItemLayout`, etc.
2. **App tokens** — `src/shared/styles/tokens.css` + `tailwind.config.ts` extensions (`bg-mcc-*`, `rounded-compact`, `p-mcc-pad`)
3. **Feature maps** — e.g. `mccThemes.ts` references token class names only

## Rules

- **No raw hex in TSX** — use semantic or `bg-mcc-*` classes
- **No arbitrary Tailwind colors** — `bg-[#e7315a]` → `bg-mcc-groceries`
- **No arbitrary radius** — `rounded-[8px]` → `rounded-compact`
- **New tokens** — add to `tokens.css`, extend Tailwind, document in `specs/tokens/token-reference.md`
- **MCC icons** — follow `specs/components/mcc-icon.md` (`TransactionCategoryIcon`)

## Allowed hex locations

- `src/shared/styles/tokens.css` (definitions)
- `wallet-stack.css`, `paymentCard.config.ts` (gradients / chrome)
- SVG assets

## Verification

```bash
npm run token-audit
npm run design-system:drift
```

